  "limitations": [
    "Ship schedule, price, quota, and availability responses are dynamic and depend on route, date/time, passenger type, and vehicle type.",
    "The classic 2026-08-20 snapshot tested 144 service/vehicle combinations and returned 72 live fares plus 72 valid empty passenger combinations across 4 OD corridors / 6 ship class routes.",
    "The 7-day period snapshot (2026-08-20 to 2026-08-26) enumerated all 140 route IDs and 2,029 unique route/service keys across 7 daily runs (14,005 test matrix rows). Live tariffs were returned for 63 routes (3,700 live fare rows across 959 route/service keys and 760 vehicle/service keys). 77 routes returned no schedule or valid source error (SCHEDULE_DATA_NOT_FOUND: 7,616, NO_SCHEDULE_FOR_DATE: 2,631, HTTP_400: 37, NO_SERVICE_TYPES: 21) across the entire 7-day window. Fares are date- and schedule-dependent point-in-time snapshots, not universal static tariffs.",
    "The trip single-day 2026-08-21 snapshot enumerated all 140 routes and 2,003 exposed service rows; 597 live fares were available across 39 routes. Remaining rows preserve source statuses and are not zero-price assumptions.",
    "The normalized all-portal CSV merges Trip and Classic without separate datasets: 3,772 live tariff rows and 14,149 matrix rows. The source column is retained for provenance only.",
